  "title": "VINFAST CONTINUES STRONG GLOBAL DELIVERY MOMENTUM IN 2Q26",
  "summary": "July 30, 2026 – VinFast Auto Ltd. (“VinFast” or the “Company”) today announced its preliminary vehicle deliveries for the second quarter of 2026. The Company delivered 70,085 electric vehicles (“EVs”) globally in the second quarter of 2026, representing a 96% increase year-over-year.",
